    // Data (FR-142, FR-143): #da-data holds, per step and state, the pack's scenario, its people and the default
    // viewer, plus each role's capabilities. "Viewing as" picks the viewer; [data-can] elements show only when the
    // viewer's role has that capability. Without script (or data) nothing is hidden.
    var DATA = null;
